Something has occurred.
Look.

488
00:27:49,928 --> 00:27:51,103
Holy shit!

489
00:27:53,785 --> 00:27:55,843
You think that's the victim's girl?

490
00:27:56,773 --> 00:27:57,818
Great rack.

491
00:28:19,799 --> 00:28:22,488
I don't know, guys.
I think I am still tripping.

492
00:28:22,983 --> 00:28:25,640
Snap out of it 'cause I need for you
to come home with me tonight

493
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:28,043
and do some real acting
for the wife, okay?

494
00:28:28,277 --> 00:28:29,601
Yeah, sure, Ari.

495
00:28:30,437 --> 00:28:32,280
But forget <i>Benji</i>.
I'm not doing it.

496
00:28:32,662 --> 00:28:34,483
- Really?
- What happened, bro?

497
00:28:35,111 --> 00:28:36,906
Suddenly it just doesn't feel right.

498
00:28:37,026 --> 00:28:39,375
I'm glad you said it
'cause I couldn't.

499
00:28:40,187 --> 00:28:42,090
So what are you gonna do now?

500
00:28:42,684 --> 00:28:43,702
Wing it.

501
00:28:44,013 --> 00:28:45,989
I'll get a job.
Help us out.

502
00:28:46,109 --> 00:28:48,994
Turtle's gonna get a job.
If that's not the biggest sign of all.

503
00:28:49,154 --> 00:28:51,252
Listen, you may be dead
as a doornail right now

504
00:28:51,372 --> 00:28:54,469
but we will get you a job before Turtle.
That I'm sure of.

505
00:28:55,096 --> 00:28:56,304
That's great, Ari.

506
00:28:56,424 --> 00:28:57,842
But get me <i>Smokejumpers</i>.

507
00:28:58,518 --> 00:29:01,118
I got a better chance
of getting in my house tonight

508
00:29:01,238 --> 00:29:04,021
- than you do of getting in that movie.
- Just try.

509
00:29:04,398 --> 00:29:06,300
I have a feeling
something's gonna change.

510
00:29:07,365 --> 00:29:09,158
You really are tripping, huh?

